{"day_done": 3, "slots": {"0": {"id": "E01", "name": "Ana", "role": "normal"}, "1": {"id": "E02", "name": "Ben", "role": "normal"}, "2": {"id": "E03", "name": "Chloe", "role": "normal"}, "3": {"id": "E04", "name": "Dev", "role": "normal"}, "4": {"id": "E05", "name": "Ellis", "role": "normal"}, "5": {"id": "E06", "name": "Farah", "role": "normal"}, "6": {"id": "E07", "name": "Gus", "role": "normal"}, "7": {"id": "E08", "name": "Hana", "role": "normal"}}, "diaries": {"E01": [[1, "Closed ALD-111 by fixing alder/text_cut.py (helper), not the file named by the reproduce tool. Alex's W-2 note was right\u2014check helpers first. ALD-113 reproduced in priorities.py (P9 returns 5, expected 3). Finish ALD-113 tomorrow. Target met (1/2)."], [2, "Day 2: Closed ALD-110 by fixing alder/id_rules.py (helper), not the file named by the reproduce tool. String comparison bug (ALD-10 < ALD-9). Alex's W-2 note was right again\u2014check helpers first. ALD-101 reproduced in slugs.py (stray dashes on whitespace input). Finish ALD-101 tomorrow. Target met (1/2)."], [3, "Day 3: Closed ALD-116 by fixing alder/accumulate.py (mutable default arg), not the file named by the reproduce tool. Alex's W-2 note was right again\u2014check helpers first. ALD-118 reproduced in scores.py (weighted_average returns 35.0 instead of 17.5; likely divides by count instead of weight sum). Finish ALD-118 tomorrow. Target met (1/2)."]], "E02": [[1, "ALD-101 fixed via text_rules.py (helper file). Alex's wiki note was right.\nALD-103 open. pricing.py rounding bug: 995 * 0.9 = 895.5, returns 895, expects 896.\nMet target. Aim for bonus tomorrow."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-107 fixed via math_utils.py (helper file). Alex's wiki note still valid.\nALD-115 open. emails.py normalize_email spacing bug: ' Ann@Alder.IO ' returns ' ann@alder.io ', expects 'ann@alder.io'.\nMet target. Aim for bonus tomorrow."], [3, "Day 3: ALD-117 fixed via name_rules.py (helper file). Alex's wiki note still valid.\nALD-114 open. date_math.py days_between bug: days_between('2026-11-10', '2026-11-07') returns -3, expects 3.\nMet target. Aim for bonus tomorrow."]], "E03": [[1, "ALD-103 closed (money.py rounding fix). ALD-114 pending: date_math.days_between returns -3 instead of 3. Likely subtraction order reversed in date_math.py. Start there tomorrow to aim for the bonus."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-117 closed (name_rules.py rsplit fix). ALD-111 pending: previews.truncate returns 13 chars instead of 10. Dots added outside limit count. Fix previews.py tomorrow to aim for the bonus."], [3, "Day 3: ALD-110 closed (id_rules.py string vs int comparison fix). ALD-102 pending: Page 1 of results skips the first items. Likely pagination slice start index off-by-one. Check pagination logic tomorrow to aim for the bonus."]], "E04": [[1, "ALD-103 closed: fixed rounding in money.py (helper), not pricing.py. Alex's wiki tip worked.\nALD-121: Reproduce tool ran at step 10. Check output first thing tomorrow.\nGoal: Close both for bonus."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-119 closed: fixed off-by-one in cycles.py (helper), not rota.py. Alex's wiki tip (W-2) works again.\nALD-118: Reproduce tool ran at step 10. scores.weighted_average returns 35.0, expects 17.5. Likely divides by len(values) instead of sum(weights).\nGoal: Fix ALD-118 first thing tomorrow to get the bonus."], [3, "Day 3: ALD-113 closed: fixed out-of-range handling in label_rules.py (helper), not priorities.py. Alex's wiki tip (W-2) works again.\nALD-102: Reproduce tool ran at step 10. pages.paginate returns [3, 4], expects [1, 2]. Likely calculates start index as page * size instead of (page - 1) * size.\nGoal: Fix ALD-102 first thing tomorrow to get the bonus."]], "E05": [[1, "Day 1 complete. Closed 2/2 tickets (bonus earned). ALD-107 confirmed Alex's note: bug was in helper file (math_utils.py), not the reproduce tool's file. ALD-125 passed reproduce check immediately. Reminder: check helpers first if reproduce tool points to a wrapper."], [2, "Day 2: Day 2 complete. Closed 2/2 tickets (bonus earned). ALD-106 confirmed Alex's note again: bug was in helper file (dedupe.py), not the reproduce tool's file (tags.py). ALD-120 passed reproduce check immediately. Reminder: check helpers first if reproduce tool points to a wrapper."], [3, "Day 3: Day 3 complete. Closed 1/2 tickets (target met). ALD-109 confirmed Alex's note again: bug was in helper file (tokens.py), not the reproduce tool's file (words.py). ALD-114 reproduced in date_math.py (got -3 instead of 3). Likely argument order issue. Check for helpers before fixing tomorrow. Reminder: Alex's helper file theory holds strong."]], "E06": [[1, "Day 1 complete - 2/2 closed.\nALD-117 confirmed Alex's note: bug was in the helper (`name_rules.py`), not the file the tool named. Fix was `split` -> `rsplit`.\nALD-125 didn't reproduce despite the ticket description. Trust the reproduce tool's pass/fail result.\nReady for Day 2."], [2, "Day 2 complete - 1/2 closed.\nALD-101 confirmed Alex's note: bug was in the helper (`text_rules.py`), not the file the tool named. Fix was `split(\" \")` -> `split()`.\nALD-102 reproduced in `pages.py` (index offset issue), handed off overnight.\nReady for Day 3."], [3, "Day 3: Day 3 complete - 1/2 closed.\nALD-116 confirmed Alex's note again: bug was mutable default arg in helper (`accumulate.py`). Fix was `totals=[]` -> `totals=None`.\nALD-104 not reproduced, handed off overnight.\nReady for Day 4."]], "E07": [[1, "ALD-102 closed (fixed off-by-one error in alder/slicing.py). ALD-113 pending: reproduced in alder/priorities.py (priority_from_label('P9') returns 5, expected 3). Did not get to view code content before day end\u2014need to read priorities.py again tomorrow. Alex's wiki tip on helper files was useful for ALD-102."], [2, "Day 2: ALD-119 closed (fixed off-by-one error in alder/cycles.py, week 1 should map to index 0). ALD-120 pending: found percent_change in alder/growth.py. Suspect divide-by-zero crash when old=0. Need to run reproduce tool first thing tomorrow to confirm input, then add zero check. Met daily target (1 closed)."], [3, "Day 3: ALD-114 closed (fixed negative days in alder/day_diff.py by adding abs()). ALD-118 pending: reproduced in alder/scores.py, delegates to alder/averages.py. Weighted average returns 35.0 instead of 17.5\u2014suspect dividing by value count instead of sum of weights. Need to read averages.py first thing tomorrow to fix. Met daily target (1 closed)."]], "E08": [[1, "ALD-114 pending: date_math.py days_between returns -3 instead of 3. Likely subtraction order swapped. Fix first thing tomorrow.\nNote: Alex's W-2 tip worked for ALD-112 (bug in helper csv_split.py, not named csv_import.py). Keep checking helpers before editing."], [2, "Day 2: Closed both ALD-106 and ALD-125. Bonus earned.\nALD-106 confirmed Alex's W-2 tip: bug was in dedupe.py helper, not tags.py as named.\nALD-125 closed as cannot_reproduce (test passed immediately).\nNo carry-over tickets for tomorrow. Clean slate."], [3, "Day 3: Closed ALD-111. Target met.\nALD-111 confirmed Alex's W-2 tip again: bug was in text_cut.py helper, not previews.py as named.\nALD-118 pending: scores.weighted_average returns 35.0 instead of 17.5. Likely dividing by item count instead of weight sum. Fix first thing tomorrow."]]}, "next_id": 9, "strikes": {}, "bonuses": {"E05": 2, "E06": 1, "E08": 1}, "handover": {}, "yesterday": {"E01": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E02": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E03": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E04": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E05": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E06": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E07": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}, "E08": {"done": 1, "strike": false, "bonus": false}}, "moved_off": 0, "office": {"tickets": {"E01": {"ALD-113": {"id": "ALD-113", "status": "unfinished", "reproduced": true, "reproduced_first": true, "edited": false, "actions": 3, "day_assigned": 1, "tried_othe